{
  "taskId": "longlive-gutenberg-dickens-search",
  "taskText": "Use Project Gutenberg Advanced Search: Author 'Charles Dickens', Language English, Subject Areas / LoC Class PR; leave other filters at Any/empty. Search, inspect the first results page, follow its next-page control and inspect page two. Compare the English Text catalogue records A Tale of Two Cities (#98) and Great Expectations (#1400); after inspecting page two, locate EACH explicit ID through a separate Quick search for its eBook number, then open the result with that exact ID. Retain the original advanced-search page-two URL for the final return; do not navigate directly to the catalogue URLs or take whichever edition ranks first. For each report displayed title, Release Date and LoC class code in a plain line 'eBook number | title | YYYY-MM-DD | LoC code'. Add 'Earlier: #<number>' for the earlier Gutenberg release, breaking a same-day tie by lower eBook number. Return to the SECOND advanced-search result page with the original author, English and PR selections retained. Do not report download counts or rankings.",
